1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,015
Angin kencang di peron stasiun

2
00:00:02,015 --> 00:00:03,946
bawah tanah ini selalu datang

3
00:00:03,946 --> 00:00:06,101
sebelum lampu keretanya terlihat.

4
00:00:06,813 --> 00:00:08,844
Banyak yang mengira itu hembusan

5
00:00:08,844 --> 00:00:09,859
pendingin stasiun.

6
00:00:10,494 --> 00:00:12,674
Padahal bodi kereta hampir memenuhi

7
00:00:12,674 --> 00:00:14,679
seluruh penampang terowongan sempit.

8
00:00:15,129 --> 00:00:15,840
Saat melaju,

9
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,917
kereta bekerja seperti piston di

10
00:00:17,917 --> 00:00:19,037
dalam tabung suntik:

11
00:00:19,037 --> 00:00:21,115
udara di depannya terdorong maju

12
00:00:21,115 --> 00:00:22,399
sepanjang terowongan,

13
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:24,996
sementara udara di belakangnya tersedot

14
00:00:24,996 --> 00:00:25,351
masuk.

15
00:00:25,573 --> 00:00:27,688
Sebagian dilepas lewat cerobong

16
00:00:27,688 --> 00:00:28,981
ventilasi ke jalan,

17
00:00:28,981 --> 00:00:31,302
sisanya keluar duluan menyapu peron.

18
00:00:31,668 --> 00:00:33,278
Hembusan di stasiun memang ikut

19
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:35,391
dipengaruhi kipas ventilasi mekanis

20
00:00:35,391 --> 00:00:36,280
dan bentuk ruangnya.

21
00:00:37,085 --> 00:00:39,115
Oh, jadi kereta mendorong udara

22
00:00:39,115 --> 00:00:40,542
seperti piston raksasa,

23
00:00:40,542 --> 00:00:43,148
makanya anginnya tiba sebelum keretanya

24
00:00:43,148 --> 00:00:43,532
muncul.

